extends layout

block headContent
	title On-chain IPFS Links

block content
	h1.h3 On-chain IPFS Links
	hr

	p.text-muted CIDs anchored on-chain via OP_RETURN /
		code glc1
		|  /
		code glc2
		|  /
		code glc3
		|  commitments. The local Kubo daemon auto-pins these.

	.mb-3
		form.row.g-2.align-items-center(method="get", action="./ipfs-links")
			.col-auto
				label.col-form-label.text-muted Limit
			.col-auto
				input.form-control.form-control-sm(type="number", name="limit", value=limit, min=1, max=500, style="width: 100px;")
			.col-auto
				label.col-form-label.text-muted Offset
			.col-auto
				input.form-control.form-control-sm(type="number", name="offset", value=offset, min=0, style="width: 100px;")
			.col-auto
				button.btn.btn-sm.btn-primary(type="submit") Apply

	if error
		.alert.alert-danger
			strong Error:
			|  #{error}
	else if !links || links.length === 0
		.alert.alert-secondary No IPFS links recorded yet.
	else
		p.text-muted #{links.length} link#{links.length === 1 ? "" : "s"} returned (limit=#{limit}, offset=#{offset}).

		.table-responsive
			table.table.table-hover.table-sm
				thead
					tr
						th Time
						th CID
						th Anchor txid
						th Description
				tbody
					each l in links
						tr
							td.text-muted.small
								if l.timestamp
									= new Date(l.timestamp * 1000).toISOString().replace("T", " ").slice(0, 19)
								else
									| —
							td
								if l.cid
									a(href="//127.0.0.1:8080/ipfs/" + l.cid, target="_blank", rel="noopener noreferrer")
										code= l.cid
								else
									| —
							td
								if l.txid
									a(href="./tx/" + l.txid)
										code= l.txid.slice(0, 16) + "…"
								else
									| —
							td.text-muted= l.description || ""

	hr
	p.text-muted.small
		| Data source: RPC
		code listipfslinks &lt;limit&gt; &lt;offset&gt;
		|  on the local Glcoin daemon. Click a CID to fetch from the local Kubo
		| gateway (
		code 127.0.0.1:8080
		| ).
